/scout
/build/
# goreleaser writes here. A release build leaves nine archives, four
# packages and the unpacked binaries in the tree; without this the next
# `git add -A` commits them. site/dist below is the SSG output, a
# different directory with the same name.
/dist/
*.test
*.out
site/dist/
# mkdocs.yml's site_dir. `mkdocs build` is how the manual is checked
# locally, and it leaves a full copy of the rendered site here.
/public/
